  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Hu Immortal blessed land Fairy Zi Wei finishes three months of deduction and treats Fang Yuan’s link to Defy as the trail Heavenly Court will press to find him. She states that Fang Yuan is a wanted criminal listed on the Demon Judgment Board by Heavenly Court. Wei Ling Yang has already sealed Spring Autumn Cicada so it cannot activate within three months. At Pot River, Ying Wu Xie reads that seal as Heavenly Court beginning to investigate and plans to leave Central Continent after refining Fixed Immortal Travel.",
      "chapters": [
        1052
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land",
        "char_fairy_zi_wei",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "house_demon_judgment_board",
        "char_wei_ling_yang",
        "gu_spring_autumn_cicada",
        "loc_pot_river",
        "char_ying_wu_xie",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "gu_fixed_immortal_travel"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Heaven Overseeing Tower Lord’s death, Fairy Zi Wei is tasked to lead Heavenly Court temporarily. Rank-eight Gu Immortals otherwise hold equal status and discuss matters together unless an Immortal Venerable leads them.",
      "chapters": [
        1069
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "court-leadership",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_heaven_overseeing_tower_lord",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Zi Wei’s prior pressure on Ying Wu Xie and the pursuit that reaches Shadow Sect’s abandoned site.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "field-pursuit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_shadow_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The few times Fairy Zi Wei took action, she drove Ying Wu Xie and the others into despair; without Fang Yuan, Ying Wu Xie would already be dead. She leads multiple Heavenly Court rank-eight Gu Immortals to the site after Ying Wu Xie and three others flee by the ancient battle formation Omni-directional Travel. She had deduced Fang Yuan there earlier, finds the trail changed, and still orders Shadow Sect killed, but stops short of chasing into the regional wall.",
      "chapters": [
        1090
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "field-pursuit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_omni_directional_travel"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Northern Plains the upper extreme heavenly eagle carries Fang Yuan into Hei Fan grotto-heaven, leaving the plains sky behind.",
      "chapters": [
        1119
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritance-contest-and-cession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "loc_hei_fan_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On Immortal Succession Mountain he finally sees Hei Fan’s true inheritance and still asks how to obtain it.",
      "chapters": [
        1121
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritance-contest-and-cession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_immortal_succession_mountain",
        "inh_hei_fan_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He later obtains the true inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        1128
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritance-contest-and-cession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He takes over the grotto-heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        1132
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritance-contest-and-cession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chu Du and Heavenly Lord Bai Zu then contest it.",
      "chapters": [
        1177
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritance-contest-and-cession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chu_du",
        "char_heavenly_lord_bai_zu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The contest ends when Chu Du allies with Bai Zu and cedes a portion of the grotto-heaven rather than fighting to the finish.",
      "chapters": [
        1181
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritance-contest-and-cession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_bai_zu_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan then leaves Hei Fan grotto-heaven, which closes this range.",
      "chapters": [
        1182
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritance-contest-and-cession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
